WEBVTT

00:01:29.980 --> 00:01:33.980
Gunma

00:01:30.860 --> 00:01:33.980
Soar on King Trumpets

00:01:31.730 --> 00:01:33.980
Hey, it's been a while, you know?

00:01:33.980 --> 00:01:37.000
So even though I'm not a believer,
I'd like to hear a sutra.

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:42.740
No priest would turn down a
request to chant sutra, right?

00:01:47.060 --> 00:01:50.270
Be a strong boy.

00:01:50.270 --> 00:01:51.500
What was that?

00:01:51.740 --> 00:01:54.590
Become strong and delicious. That's Bisco.

00:01:54.590 --> 00:01:58.110
It's a powerful name,
given along with loving prayers.

00:01:58.110 --> 00:02:00.510
It's not a name for the
likes of you to mock!

00:02:00.510 --> 00:02:02.520
Hey, you're no priest!

00:02:02.520 --> 00:02:05.510
Now say, "Bisco-san, I'm sorry"!

00:02:14.560 --> 00:02:15.910
Th-The man-eater...

00:02:16.340 --> 00:02:17.780
It's the man-eater, Akaboshi!

00:02:18.190 --> 00:02:20.290
Who're you callin' a man-eater?!

00:02:24.890 --> 00:02:26.400
Inoshige-san!

00:02:26.400 --> 00:02:28.410
L-Look! Look!

00:02:28.410 --> 00:02:32.750
Th-Those are muh... mush... mushrooms!

00:02:32.750 --> 00:02:34.540
You dumbass! Run, Ota!

00:02:39.340 --> 00:02:42.960
You won't get much medicinal
value out of grinding up shimeji.

00:02:42.960 --> 00:02:44.310
Better to just eat 'em.

00:02:45.920 --> 00:02:47.550
A lurkershroom.

00:02:47.840 --> 00:02:49.820
This is the best one for healing.

00:02:50.230 --> 00:02:51.370
Put that in instead.

00:02:51.700 --> 00:02:55.400
I-I can't. It's a crime to synthesize
medicine w-without permission...

00:02:55.400 --> 00:02:56.310
But you just were.

00:02:58.870 --> 00:03:01.720
I threatened three people,
and all three recommended you.

00:03:01.720 --> 00:03:02.950
You're a great doctor, right?

00:03:04.950 --> 00:03:06.450
I'm short on time.

00:03:06.450 --> 00:03:08.940
Any more bellyaching and
I'm sorry, but you're dead.

00:03:12.080 --> 00:03:14.290
Smells like a Salmo Rot Shot.

00:03:14.290 --> 00:03:14.820
Huh?

00:03:15.330 --> 00:03:18.060
Was he hit by an Escargot?

00:03:18.580 --> 00:03:22.820
You can't put bandages directly on the
wound! The rot will remain and get worse!

00:03:22.820 --> 00:03:23.590
What did you say?

00:03:23.590 --> 00:03:27.090
Trying to save him by just giving
him an injection is too naïve!

00:03:27.090 --> 00:03:29.600
I said you're dead if you keep bellyaching!

00:03:30.050 --> 00:03:32.010
And I'll keep saying it until you kill me!

00:03:32.350 --> 00:03:35.060
This wound won't heal if
it's not treated properly.

00:03:35.060 --> 00:03:37.370
Please, let me operate on him.

00:03:37.830 --> 00:03:41.190
Because at this rate,
that old man's going to die!

00:03:44.870 --> 00:03:46.670
Okay, fine.

00:03:46.670 --> 00:03:49.360
But start synthesizing first.
How long will it take?

00:03:49.640 --> 00:03:53.380
It depends on the ingredients,
but at least twenty minutes.

00:03:53.610 --> 00:03:55.080
Do it in ten.

00:04:04.270 --> 00:04:06.390
Who the hell are those masked creeps?

00:04:06.890 --> 00:04:08.900
They're not the Watch, are they?

00:04:10.760 --> 00:04:12.340
Akaboshi!

00:04:12.340 --> 00:04:13.760
Akaboshi Bisco!

00:04:14.080 --> 00:04:16.710
In light of your 28 prior counts
of mushroom terrorism,

00:04:16.710 --> 00:04:20.770
the governor of Imihama has ordered
us to kill you if you resist arrest!

00:04:20.780 --> 00:04:26.280
Panda
Clinic

00:04:21.050 --> 00:04:23.260
Surrender before we fill you full of lead!

00:04:23.260 --> 00:04:26.270
I've got a hostage here,
so think before you start shooting!

00:04:26.270 --> 00:04:30.870
Open fire again and Doctor Panda here
loses his head, you morons!

00:04:38.920 --> 00:04:40.920
Panda
Clinic

00:04:46.330 --> 00:04:48.750
They opened fire without
any damn hesitation.

00:04:49.300 --> 00:04:51.810
Man, they've got no love for you, huh?

00:04:51.810 --> 00:04:54.310
N-No way...

00:04:56.430 --> 00:04:58.300
They'll storm the place soon.

00:04:58.300 --> 00:05:00.430
Sorry, but I'm blowin' up this hospital.

00:05:00.430 --> 00:05:01.060
Right.

00:05:01.310 --> 00:05:03.310
Huh?! Wh-What did you just—

00:05:03.820 --> 00:05:05.500
You're carrying the old man.

00:05:18.300 --> 00:05:19.830
Good. Now let's go.

00:05:19.830 --> 00:05:21.100
Ah, hold on!

00:05:21.100 --> 00:05:23.340
I have a wheelchair. At least put him in it.

00:05:23.340 --> 00:05:25.330
No time. They're already blooming.

00:05:25.680 --> 00:05:26.840
Blooming?

00:05:32.930 --> 00:05:34.710
Jabi! We failed!

00:05:34.710 --> 00:05:36.930
We're escaping along the wall!
Wake up Actagawa!

00:05:37.940 --> 00:05:40.190
See? What did I tell you?

00:05:45.180 --> 00:05:49.630
If you're gonna pull a <i>Kanjincho</i>,
you gotta learn a sutra or two.

00:05:49.630 --> 00:05:53.070
I can recite one: Jamon Kimnara Hosu Yakshai.

00:05:53.070 --> 00:05:56.820
You're the one who said the Flamebound
gets through on sight in Kantou!

00:06:01.200 --> 00:06:03.720
The bastard mobilized the damn hippos.

00:06:33.760 --> 00:06:35.240
This is just getting worse.

00:06:35.940 --> 00:06:37.750
Jabi, give me ten seconds.

00:06:38.440 --> 00:06:39.860
We're soaring on king trumpets.

00:06:50.960 --> 00:06:52.500
Shut the hell up.

00:06:52.500 --> 00:06:53.510
M-My hospital!

00:06:53.730 --> 00:06:54.590
Yeah.

00:06:54.590 --> 00:06:55.670
Mine!

00:06:55.670 --> 00:06:57.510
That's why I told you I was doing it.

00:06:57.510 --> 00:06:59.710
Sorry, but we had no choice.

00:06:59.710 --> 00:07:02.110
If I hadn't done that,
you'd have bit the dust, too.

00:07:05.930 --> 00:07:07.020
Don't move.

00:07:17.320 --> 00:07:19.540
They'll figure it out soon. Let's go.

00:07:19.540 --> 00:07:22.040
Imi

00:07:26.670 --> 00:07:29.340
Imihama Watch Station

00:07:32.030 --> 00:07:33.000
Captain!

00:07:33.800 --> 00:07:35.200
Captain Pawoo!

00:07:35.200 --> 00:07:36.560
Status?

00:07:36.560 --> 00:07:40.930
The terrorist, Akaboshi, made a large number
of mushrooms bloom on Karakusa Street,

00:07:40.930 --> 00:07:44.130
then fled into the Kotsutsubo
shopping district and disappeared.

00:07:44.130 --> 00:07:47.570
Judging from the mushroom trail,
he's headed for the governor's office.

00:07:47.570 --> 00:07:49.850
Aiming straight for the heart?

00:07:50.240 --> 00:07:52.230
Sounds like the plan of a barbarian.

00:07:52.230 --> 00:07:54.010
Yes, ma'am! I thought so, too,

00:07:54.010 --> 00:07:57.990
so I already sent Division 2 Squads 3
through 8 to guard the governor's office.

00:07:57.990 --> 00:08:02.440
Even Akaboshi the man-eater can't
handle our elite squad of iguana cavalry.

00:08:02.440 --> 00:08:04.330
Vice Captain! Vice Captain, sir!

00:08:04.610 --> 00:08:05.710
What is it?

00:08:05.710 --> 00:08:07.380
Oh, Captain Pawoo!

00:08:07.620 --> 00:08:11.220
The governor's elite forces have bolstered
the defenses around the governor's office,

00:08:11.220 --> 00:08:13.630
and they sent us away,
saying they didn't need us.

00:08:13.820 --> 00:08:14.550
What?

00:08:14.550 --> 00:08:17.930
So we raced to Karakusa Street and
found the governor's elite forces there, too,

00:08:17.930 --> 00:08:20.520
already engaged in battle with Akaboshi.

00:08:20.740 --> 00:08:25.200
The governor's calling the shots again?
What does he think the Watch is for?

00:08:26.590 --> 00:08:29.280
Damn that Kurokawa. What's he thinking?

00:08:29.550 --> 00:08:30.450
Whoa!

00:08:33.420 --> 00:08:34.230
Nine...

00:08:35.400 --> 00:08:36.460
Eight...

00:08:36.460 --> 00:08:37.400
Seven...

00:08:37.400 --> 00:08:38.280
Six...

00:08:38.280 --> 00:08:39.160
Five...

00:08:39.400 --> 00:08:40.130
Four...

00:08:44.750 --> 00:08:46.170
We've got them cornered.

00:08:47.320 --> 00:08:48.180
Three...

00:08:48.180 --> 00:08:49.130
Two...

00:08:49.130 --> 00:08:49.910
One...

00:08:50.290 --> 00:08:51.160
Jabi!

00:09:00.810 --> 00:09:02.940
That kid's a monster!

00:09:20.990 --> 00:09:23.540
Uh, so...

00:09:23.540 --> 00:09:26.320
About that Akaboshi guy...

00:09:26.320 --> 00:09:27.440
Uh...

00:09:28.360 --> 00:09:31.240
I-I failed to finish him off.

00:09:31.460 --> 00:09:33.520
That much is obvious, fool.

00:09:33.520 --> 00:09:36.310
Even with military aircraft,
you couldn't kill one man?

00:09:36.310 --> 00:09:39.260
B-But I'm sure I took out the
old man he's partners with!

00:09:39.260 --> 00:09:41.210
I landed a direct hit with the machine gun.

00:09:45.530 --> 00:09:48.070
The problem was Akaboshi.

00:09:48.070 --> 00:09:50.790
That guy's impossible.
He's nothing like you said he was.

00:09:51.110 --> 00:09:53.220
You said he was just some archer,

00:09:53.220 --> 00:09:56.520
but that bow of his put a hole
in the stomach of our Escargot.

00:09:56.520 --> 00:09:58.790
You can't even call that thing a bow anymore.

00:09:58.790 --> 00:10:01.780
That thing's like thunder
or lightning, you know?

00:10:01.780 --> 00:10:04.110
Hey, are you being serious?

00:10:04.110 --> 00:10:07.780
You're saying Akaboshi's arrows have
the power to down an Escargot fighter?

00:10:07.990 --> 00:10:11.790
It appears he plans to flee west through the
governor's office. We'll pursue and down him.

00:10:11.790 --> 00:10:14.230
It'll be a problem if the Watch beats us to him.

00:10:14.230 --> 00:10:16.790
Kill him before Pawoo apprehends him.

00:10:17.640 --> 00:10:19.850
Through the governor's office, huh?

00:10:20.290 --> 00:10:23.030
Split into two teams.
Send 70% to the governor's office,

00:10:23.030 --> 00:10:25.650
and have the remaining 30% search downtown.

00:10:25.650 --> 00:10:27.310
Search downtown?

00:10:28.820 --> 00:10:30.330
Yes, sir. At once!

00:10:31.800 --> 00:10:33.170
Um...

00:10:33.170 --> 00:10:35.450
You will pay out on the insurance, right?

00:10:35.450 --> 00:10:38.690
That Escargot was my personal plane, you see.

00:10:38.690 --> 00:10:42.200
Of course I will. I'll pay it
alongside his funeral offering.

00:10:44.480 --> 00:10:47.200
Now, you go look around downtown, too.

00:10:47.470 --> 00:10:48.930
I'll send twenty men with you.

00:10:48.930 --> 00:10:49.930
Huh? What?!

00:10:49.930 --> 00:10:51.630
You want me to go fight Akaboshi myself?!

00:10:50.620 --> 00:10:52.720
You accepted the paycheck, didn't you?

00:10:52.720 --> 00:10:56.060
I think it'd be better than getting
hanged for breaking a contract.

00:10:57.640 --> 00:10:59.480
Mobster governor.

00:11:02.160 --> 00:11:06.120
Good grief. You need to take into account
a person's skill set when hiring help.

00:11:06.120 --> 00:11:10.730
Apparently, her pitch was that she
owned her own Escargot fighter.

00:11:11.230 --> 00:11:17.310
Well, it's unavoidable. The lights of
a town always draw in flies like that.

00:11:17.310 --> 00:11:19.740
You got her to take the meds, right?

00:11:19.740 --> 00:11:21.300
Yes, I made certain.

00:11:21.490 --> 00:11:30.000
Movie Theater

00:11:21.610 --> 00:11:23.800
He's really done it now.

00:11:23.800 --> 00:11:26.660
I was planning to have my own
sci-fi festival tomorrow

00:11:26.660 --> 00:11:29.490
and enjoy an airing of
back-to-back masterpieces.

00:11:29.490 --> 00:11:31.350
You have my sympathy.

00:11:31.350 --> 00:11:35.610
Moron. My thoughts aren't so simple
that you can empathize with them.

00:11:44.970 --> 00:11:48.100
Welcome to Imihama Prefecture

00:11:44.970 --> 00:11:48.100
The town of friendship!!

00:11:48.100 --> 00:11:50.100
Welcome to Imihama Prefecture

00:11:50.100 --> 00:11:51.800
They're mocking the hell outta us.

00:11:50.100 --> 00:11:52.600
The town of friendship!!

00:11:54.950 --> 00:11:57.480
It's flourishing right in our damn way.

00:11:59.750 --> 00:12:01.370
Welcome back.

00:12:01.370 --> 00:12:05.360
So what's up? Did the Watch come out?

00:12:05.590 --> 00:12:09.880
Nope, business as usual, for now.
No wanted posters going around, either.

00:12:11.220 --> 00:12:14.890
That's because Gunma and Imihama have
hated each other for a long time now.

00:12:14.890 --> 00:12:17.390
All the way back to the previous governor.

00:12:17.670 --> 00:12:20.510
Enough about the old days.
I'm sick of hearing it.

00:12:20.510 --> 00:12:23.390
More importantly, it's time for your
medicine. Take off your clothes.

00:12:23.760 --> 00:12:26.870
Hey! How many times do I gotta say it
before you understand, old man?

00:12:26.870 --> 00:12:29.260
Show me your Rust before you eat.

00:12:29.260 --> 00:12:31.400
What's it matter if I
have a little taste first?

00:12:31.400 --> 00:12:35.390
You're not being very nice to your
mentor who's not long for this world.

00:12:36.560 --> 00:12:38.390
We don't have much time left.

00:12:38.740 --> 00:12:40.580
It'll reach your lungs soon.

00:12:43.040 --> 00:12:45.330
Don't scowl like that.

00:12:45.330 --> 00:12:46.780
Eat up, Bisco.

00:12:47.050 --> 00:12:48.610
Today's soup is delicious.

00:12:48.610 --> 00:12:51.170
There's plenty of fat from iron mice in it.

00:12:51.370 --> 00:12:54.570
If you don't eat up, you won't be able
to draw your bow when it counts.

00:12:55.050 --> 00:12:56.400
That's bitter!

00:12:56.660 --> 00:12:58.680
Did you remember to remove the guts?

00:12:58.680 --> 00:13:01.110
It's your fault for chewing.

00:13:01.110 --> 00:13:03.390
Just slurp it down in one gulp.

00:13:03.960 --> 00:13:06.970
Says the guy with no teeth.
You just can't chew anymore.

00:13:10.560 --> 00:13:11.670
Jabi.

00:13:11.670 --> 00:13:14.160
Normal mushrooms won't cut it anymore.

00:13:14.160 --> 00:13:15.680
We need the Rust Eater right away.

00:13:17.680 --> 00:13:20.110
We'll pick up our pace a bit.

00:13:20.110 --> 00:13:23.100
Once we're out of Imihama,
there are no more checkpoints.

00:13:23.100 --> 00:13:24.440
It's a straight shot to Akita.

00:13:24.940 --> 00:13:26.170
Bisco.

00:13:26.170 --> 00:13:26.940
Huh?

00:13:26.940 --> 00:13:30.510
I've taught you everything I know how to do.

00:13:30.510 --> 00:13:33.320
Mushroom control. Crab riding.
How to use a bow.

00:13:33.820 --> 00:13:36.260
You're even better with a bow than me now.

00:13:36.740 --> 00:13:41.130
Though synthesizing medicine is the
one thing you were never any good at.

00:13:41.130 --> 00:13:45.600
But on the whole, few Mushroom Keepers
can match your physique and skills.

00:13:45.970 --> 00:13:49.590
Though, if I had to say, my only regret is that...

00:13:50.620 --> 00:13:53.600
Bisco, when I die...

00:13:53.870 --> 00:13:55.090
Shut up.

00:13:55.090 --> 00:13:56.610
Listen, Bisco.

00:13:56.850 --> 00:13:58.590
Shut up! Be quiet!

00:13:58.830 --> 00:14:02.970
I've battled through ten or twenty checkpoints
on this journey to stop that from happening!

00:14:02.970 --> 00:14:06.220
You always, always talk as
if your life doesn't matter.

00:14:06.220 --> 00:14:08.730
You want to rust away and croak that badly?

00:14:10.480 --> 00:14:13.260
Every minute of our travels
has been exhilarating.

00:14:13.260 --> 00:14:16.790
Do you remember how we got
through Mt. Hiei at Shiga?

00:14:16.790 --> 00:14:20.230
You cut the rope of the ropeway
right before the checkpoint

00:14:20.230 --> 00:14:21.870
and swung through like Tarzan—

00:14:21.870 --> 00:14:23.190
Cut it out already!

00:14:23.190 --> 00:14:25.260
This isn't some training journey!

00:14:25.640 --> 00:14:28.770
I refuse to have an old geezer
drag me down and croak on me!

00:14:33.510 --> 00:14:37.300
Next time you spout such
nonsense, I'm punching you.

00:14:39.570 --> 00:14:42.770
I've turned such a kind child
into such a mad fighter.

00:14:43.200 --> 00:14:48.280
I'm probably going to die, Bisco,
and leave you behind, all dried up like this.

00:14:48.610 --> 00:14:52.660
I only hope that someone
comes along afterward and...

00:14:53.350 --> 00:14:55.650
Have you eaten, Actagawa?

00:14:57.540 --> 00:15:02.290
I'm jealous of you, always living life
at your own pace, totally stress-free.

00:15:05.240 --> 00:15:07.540
If only I'd been born a crab, too.

00:15:07.970 --> 00:15:11.340
Nah, on second thought, I wouldn't
want anyone riding on top of me.

00:15:20.170 --> 00:15:21.310
What?

00:15:34.700 --> 00:15:37.570
Wh-What?! My missile...

00:15:40.570 --> 00:15:41.710
Shit!

00:15:41.710 --> 00:15:43.110
What is that thing?!

00:15:43.970 --> 00:15:47.330
One of Matoba Manufacturing's... snails?

00:15:45.340 --> 00:15:47.340
Matoba

00:15:45.340 --> 00:15:47.340
Manufacturing

00:15:48.180 --> 00:15:49.830
Why's it here?

00:15:49.830 --> 00:15:51.650
Then try this one!

00:15:52.340 --> 00:15:53.700
Bisco!

00:15:53.700 --> 00:15:54.840
It's gonna spew!

00:15:54.840 --> 00:15:57.460
Hide under Actagawa!

00:16:06.580 --> 00:16:08.720
That's an Escargot fighter.

00:16:08.720 --> 00:16:11.230
But it's not flying the colors
of the Imihama Watch.

00:16:11.460 --> 00:16:12.980
Why's it after us?

00:16:13.840 --> 00:16:16.290
Arrows won't work on that heavy armor.

00:16:16.290 --> 00:16:18.950
Get into Imihama and escape into the city!

00:16:18.950 --> 00:16:21.500
What have they got against us?

00:16:22.030 --> 00:16:24.070
They keep getting in our damn way!

00:16:31.870 --> 00:16:33.370
Bisco!

00:16:47.620 --> 00:16:49.860
Run, Bisco.

00:16:55.660 --> 00:16:56.900
Jabi!

00:17:01.670 --> 00:17:03.930
Bastards!

00:17:21.950 --> 00:17:24.190
I have to find a doctor in Imihama fast!

00:17:24.190 --> 00:17:26.180
I will save him!

00:17:26.180 --> 00:17:28.180
Don't die, Jabi!

00:17:34.380 --> 00:17:35.330
Well?

00:17:35.690 --> 00:17:37.010
Six shots...

00:17:37.400 --> 00:17:40.450
Powerful enough to kill him
twice over. Normally, at least.

00:17:40.680 --> 00:17:42.200
What's the deal with this guy?

00:17:42.200 --> 00:17:45.460
Even with these wounds, his pulse
and breathing haven't changed.

00:17:45.960 --> 00:17:47.330
Can you save him?

00:17:47.850 --> 00:17:49.830
It depends on this injection.

00:17:50.090 --> 00:17:53.180
I'll open him up and remove
both the rot and the bullets.

00:17:53.180 --> 00:17:56.620
Then I'll inject him with this,
and as long as his body holds out...

00:17:56.620 --> 00:17:58.100
Wait! Where are you going?

00:17:58.820 --> 00:18:01.860
If I just stand around here,
we'll get surrounded again,

00:18:01.860 --> 00:18:04.990
so I'll go confuse our pursuers.
Take care of the old man—

00:18:04.990 --> 00:18:06.090
No, you can't!

00:18:06.870 --> 00:18:08.280
What the hell are you doing?

00:18:08.280 --> 00:18:11.470
You're badly wounded, too.
Are you trying to get yourself killed?

00:18:11.470 --> 00:18:13.780
I'll treat you. Now, sit down!

00:18:13.780 --> 00:18:15.490
I'm fine, dummy!

00:18:15.490 --> 00:18:17.130
Heal the old man!

00:18:17.130 --> 00:18:18.360
Hey, let go of my hand.

00:18:18.360 --> 00:18:19.610
You're not fine!

00:18:19.610 --> 00:18:22.370
I can't just leave someone
covered in so much blood alone!

00:18:22.710 --> 00:18:23.950
At the very least...

00:18:23.950 --> 00:18:28.130
At least let me stitch up your head.
The blood keeps getting in your eyes.

00:18:28.130 --> 00:18:31.130
If you go out like that, all you'll do is die!

00:18:36.160 --> 00:18:38.370
There, all done.

00:18:40.840 --> 00:18:43.630
Um, does it hurt?

00:18:43.630 --> 00:18:46.640
No. I see now how talented you are.

00:18:46.890 --> 00:18:49.390
Really? That's great!

00:18:50.070 --> 00:18:52.530
Okay, I'm heading out. Take care of Jabi.

00:18:52.530 --> 00:18:53.520
U-Um...

00:18:53.520 --> 00:18:55.410
Gimme a break. What is it now?

00:18:55.410 --> 00:18:58.710
Akaboshi-san, if you get injured
again, come right back here.

00:18:58.710 --> 00:19:00.400
I'll make sure to heal you.

00:19:01.080 --> 00:19:02.900
What's your name?

00:19:02.900 --> 00:19:05.720
U-Uh... it's Milo.

00:19:06.080 --> 00:19:07.410
Nekoyanagi Milo.

00:19:08.050 --> 00:19:08.970
Milo.

00:19:09.880 --> 00:19:10.620
Well...

00:19:12.130 --> 00:19:13.130
Thanks.

00:19:21.520 --> 00:19:22.650
Captain!

00:19:22.650 --> 00:19:24.330
Captain Pawoo!

00:19:25.140 --> 00:19:27.430
The trail to the governor's
office was a bluff!

00:19:28.140 --> 00:19:32.150
Akaboshi's currently wreaking
havoc over near the West Gate!

00:19:32.150 --> 00:19:34.120
What is it? What did you see?

00:19:34.120 --> 00:19:36.040
Hey! Bring some water!

00:19:36.040 --> 00:19:39.080
The bunny masks are the
ones fighting Akaboshi.

00:19:39.080 --> 00:19:41.880
The ones believed to be Governor
Kurokawa's elite forces.

00:19:42.930 --> 00:19:44.390
There's a lot of them,

00:19:44.390 --> 00:19:47.660
and they're proving to be no match
for Akaboshi, who's fighting alone.

00:19:47.870 --> 00:19:50.030
Tsk, acting on his own again.

00:19:50.030 --> 00:19:54.050
Also, Captain Pawoo... Please
remain calm when you hear this.

00:19:54.320 --> 00:19:55.040
What is it?

00:19:55.500 --> 00:19:59.630
We witnessed a huge
mushroom sprout downtown.

00:19:59.630 --> 00:20:01.810
At the Panda Clinic.

00:20:02.080 --> 00:20:03.810
Where your little brother...

00:20:05.660 --> 00:20:09.820
Lift the cordon around the governor's office
and send Squads 2, 3, and 4 to the West Gate.

00:20:09.820 --> 00:20:11.800
Have Squad 9 go to the North Gate.

00:20:11.800 --> 00:20:14.560
A-Are you planning to
go ahead by yourself?

00:20:14.560 --> 00:20:17.320
You're up against a villain
who's wanted nationally!

00:20:17.560 --> 00:20:19.740
What about it?

00:20:27.740 --> 00:20:29.800
Well, that about takes care of that.

00:20:30.690 --> 00:20:33.200
Though the Watch doesn't
seem to be showing up.

00:20:33.560 --> 00:20:34.830
Why not?

00:20:41.100 --> 00:20:43.700
W-Wait! Just hold on a second!

00:20:43.700 --> 00:20:45.600
I-I was against this!

00:20:45.830 --> 00:20:50.090
I told them such a kind man
could never be a villain, right?

00:20:50.090 --> 00:20:52.600
Yet that governor forced me to do this!

00:20:52.600 --> 00:20:56.010
Who in the hell are you people?
What happened to the Watch?

00:20:56.010 --> 00:20:58.540
I-I'm quitting this line of work!

00:20:58.540 --> 00:21:03.620
H-Hey, killing such an innocent girl
would just haunt your dreams, right?

00:21:03.620 --> 00:21:05.790
L-Let's make a deal.

00:21:08.610 --> 00:21:09.630
A bike?

00:21:22.900 --> 00:21:25.120
Now that's a scary-ass way to ride.

00:21:28.950 --> 00:21:30.520
License suspended, dimwit!

00:21:39.140 --> 00:21:42.160
Is that all you've got, Man-Eater Akaboshi?

00:23:24.920 --> 00:23:37.930
Next Episode Preview

00:23:25.730 --> 00:23:26.620
Red and blue.

00:23:26.620 --> 00:23:30.980
When those two stars meet, a new
constellation is born in the ruined sky.

00:23:30.980 --> 00:23:35.020
But who would believe that this moment,
this carnage would be the star of destiny?

00:23:35.310 --> 00:23:36.560
Next episode: "Tag Team."

00:23:36.920 --> 00:23:39.330
Divine punishment shall be swift,
and evil shall be vanquished!

00:23:37.930 --> 00:23:39.930
Tag Team
